# Patterns match from the context root, so the bare form covers `/.env` alone —
# and this repo's development env file is `packages/api/.env`. A build from a
# working tree (`docker compose up --build`, issue #140) would otherwise copy a
# real TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY into an image layer. `.env.example` is not matched
# by any of these and still ships.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
